type: article
title: "An Explicit Evaluation of a Fibonacci Character Sum for Primes with Full Rank of Apparition"
authors:
  - family-names: "Ghandali"
    given-names: "Majid"
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher, Tehran, Iran"
